NOTICE 00000 aanimals <- woof! (PL/pgSQL function wbark(text) line 1 at RAISE)
NOTICE 00000 trigger wpart_odd on wpart1 (a,b)=(1,aardvark) (PL/pgSQL function wnote() line 1 at RAISE)
